# The troll fight is random and has to be fought out to the kill;
# unlike the English seed's comment, this build's code makes its own
# RANDOM calls at different points even from the identical command
# sequence, so the number of hits it takes isn't the English script's
# three -- here it took four. Anything beyond the kill just wastes a
# turn standing in an empty room, and once (during an early, since
# corrected, version of this run) that wasted turn was exactly when
# the thief wandered in and robbed the room blind. So this stops
# dead the instant the death message prints, no padding.

töte troll
töte troll
töte troll
töte troll

# Rope tied off at the Dome Room, then down to the Temple complex
# for the coffin. Sword and painting both get set down here in the
# Egyptian Room -- the coffin alone, with the lamp, is exactly what
# this build's carry limit allows.

