# Down through the trapdoor again (it reopens fine from the Living
# Room side even after the first descent locked it from below), then
# the thief's maze: north out of the Cellar into the Troll Room,
# west into the maze proper, and this exact west/south/east/up run
# is the one path through it to the room with the skeleton, key, and
# bag of gold -- the maze's layout doesn't care what language is
# asking, so the English walkthrough's own maze directions carry
# over unchanged. The thief gets one free stab in passing through
# the Cellar on the way down; that's ordinary for this stretch of
# the game, not a sign anything went wrong.

